# Current Docs Routing

Cursor-only adapter. Codex and Claude follow root `AGENTS.md`, `knowledge/TOOLING_POLICY.md`, and their own host rules.

When the task is about a library, framework, SDK, API, CLI tool, or cloud service, use one current documentation tool and cite the current docs.

- Prefer Context7 in Cursor when it is available and current.
- Do not duplicate the same lookup through multiple doc tools.
- For local code, configs, tests, or repo contracts, use source reads instead of docs tooling.

Do not use docs tooling as a substitute for current implementation truth.
